<title>USA: EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</title>
<headline>EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</headline>
<text>
<p>Averages (1,000 bbls/day) for first 249 days of 1996:</p>
<p>---------------------------1996------1995----Pct Chg</p>
<p> Gasoline..................7,832.....7,786......0.6</p>
<p> Distillate Fuel ..........3,334.....3,178......4.9</p>
<p> Residual Fuel...............853.......839......1.7</p>
<p> Jet Fuel..................1,563.....1,487 .....5.1</p>
<p> Other Oils................4,514.....4,301......5.0</p>
<p> Total Products Supplied..18,096....17,592......2.9</p>
<p> Domestic Crude Output.....6,477.....6,592.....-1.7</p>
<p> Crude Imports (Exc SPR)...7,524.....7,201......4.5</p>
<p> Refinery Crude Runs......14,126....13,989......1.0</p>
</text>
